```

Output:

```text
stash@{0}: WIP on master: a705ad5 3
stash@{1}: WIP on feature-profile: 35fe775 file
```

### Important Concept

Git stores stashes using references such as:

```text
stash@{0}
stash@{1}
stash@{2}
```

The newest stash is normally:

```text
